     registry/modules.cxd's sso row says where the artifacts land in a built
     tree. The history filter's path list (scripts/repo_paths.cx, and
     tooling/repo-template/HISTORY-FILTER.md §1) is therefore SPENT for this
     repository -- it produced the repository, and the repository is now the
     source of truth for what belongs to it. ]

